Third-party data in this directory

table.q15 is a derived table built from the SADIE II database (subject D1, a Neumann KU100 dummy head), measured at The Audio
Lab, Department of Electronic Engineering, University of York, UK, by Cal Armstrong, Lewis Thresh and Gavin Kearney as part of
the SADIE Project.

