record 12092466 (doi:10.5281/zenodo.12092466), which carries the Apache-2.0 licence text as LICENSE.txt.

Changes made (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)): the 256-tap, 48 kHz, 24-bit right-ear responses nearest to azimuths -180..180 degrees in
5 degree steps and elevations 0, 15 and 30 degrees were selected from the WAV files; one common onset delay of 59 samples was
removed from all of them; the tails were faded with a raised cosine; the energy average over all directions was equalised to a
flat diffuse field (minimum-phase, 1/3-octave smoothing, limited to +-12 dB); the level was scaled to a fixed peak and the
responses quantised to 16 bit. The left ear is the mirror of the right. The table is produced by tools/hrtfgen; the header of
table.q15 records the sha256 of the source archive and of the list of source files. The raw dataset is not part of this
repository.
